# Tilecast Edge display control (docs/tilecast-edge.md §4.3): tilecastd
# reaches HDMI-CEC adapters and the display's DDC/CI bus through the
# tilecast-display group, never as root. Only tilecast-edge.service joins
# the group (SupplementaryGroups=); the tilecast account itself is not a
# member, so the renderer and the session bridge do not inherit it.
SUBSYSTEM=="cec", KERNEL=="cec[0-9]*", GROUP="tilecast-display", MODE="0660"
# DDC/CI: only I2C buses whose parent is a display adapter (PCI base class
# 0x03: VGA, 3D controller, other display), never the SMBus or other I2C
# devices. ddcutil matches display adapters the same way; unlike ddcutil,
# access goes to one group that only tilecastd's unit joins, not to the
# desktop user.
SUBSYSTEM=="i2c-dev", KERNEL=="i2c-[0-9]*", ATTRS{class}=="0x03*", GROUP="tilecast-display", MODE="0660"
